## Interface: 30300
## Title: PassLootBiS Scanner
## Notes: Live loot-roll upgrade scanner. Scores rolled items against your equipped gear using per-spec stat weights read from the item's own tooltip, and tells you if it is an upgrade.
## Author: Digigull
## Version: 0.1.0-alpha
## SavedVariables: PassLootBiS_ScannerDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: PassLootBiS_ScannerCharDB
## OptionalDeps: PasslootBiS, Auctionator-Finder-Ascension, Auctionator
## X-Category: Loot
## X-Website: https://github.com/Digigull/BiS-Scanner

# --- Embedded libraries (LibStub keeps only the newest copy at runtime) ---
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\LibScaledStats-1.0\LibScaledStats-1.0.lua

# --- Baked stat weights (generated from weights.json by tools/build_weights.py) ---
Data\Weights.lua

# --- Pure logic cores (offline-testable under lua5.1) ---
Core\Score.lua
Core\Slots.lua
Core\SpecWeights.lua
Core\Filter.lua
Core\Verdict.lua

# --- Optional integrations (guarded global reads). MUST load before Scanner,
#     which captures ns.Auctionator as a load-time local (nil if loaded later). ---
Integrations\Auctionator.lua

# --- UI + event flow (WoW-API, guarded) ---
Core\UI.lua
Core\Alert.lua
Core\Scanner.lua
Core\Tooltip.lua

# --- Minimap button + settings window (load after Scanner: need ns.setSpec/ns.db) ---
Core\MinimapButton.lua
Core\Options.lua

# --- Drag-freeze isolation harness (DEBUG; /plbisscan dragtest). Loads last. ---
Core\DragTest.lua
